s dynamic as possible so you will not be able to reload any weapons. Whatever is in the gun is what you get. Run out of ammo? simply throw it away so you can grab a new one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Further you travel, difficulty increases. How Far Will You Survive.</p>","developers":["Shaun"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505240/header.jpg?t=1740908609","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093980,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093980/movie480.mp4?t=1739549748","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093980/movie_max.mp4?t=1739549748"},"name":"Deaded The Runner Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093980/2a08edb9a341262349b35916b746d1d210f5ed6b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739549748","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093980/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739549748","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093980/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739549748"}}],"name":"Deaded The Runner","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Deaded The Runner - $0.99 USD","packageid":1237698,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Deaded The Runner"}],"packages":[1237698],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory: